# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
# address made plural (Claude)
msgid ""
"The Werewolves butchered us.  Will you avenge us - so our souls may rest in peace?"
msgstr ""
"Die Werwölfe haben uns auseinandergenommen. Werdet Ihr uns rächen - damit unsere Seelen in Frieden ruhen können?"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
msgid "The bones feel incredibly cold to the touch."
msgstr "Die Knochen fühlen sich unglaublich kalt an."

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
msgid "The cave is empty"
msgstr "Die Höhle ist leer"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
msgid ""
"The cleric appears again and nods at you -Thank you I will never forget your kindness I can rest in peace at last -  He then fades away."
msgstr ""
"Der Kleriker erscheint erneut und nickt: Danke, ich werde Euren Gefallen niemals vergessen, nun kann ich endlich in Frieden ruhen. - Dann verschwindet er."

