msgstr "Ihr sprecht ein Gebet für die Knochen."

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
# address made plural (Claude)
msgid "You scoop away a handful of someone's hopes and dreams."
msgstr "Ihr schaufelt eine Handvoll Hoffnungen und Träume fort."

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
# address made plural (Claude)
msgid "You toss a few coins into the fountain."
msgstr "Ihr werft einige Münzen in die Quelle."

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
# address made plural (Claude)
msgid "You were unable to pick the lock."
msgstr "Ihr wart unfähig, das Schloß zu knacken."

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
# address made plural (Claude)
msgid "Your muscles expand as you take a drink."
msgstr "Eure Muskeln vergrößern sich, als Ihr einen Schluck nehmt."
